      <description>Vibrance of Surajkund International Crafts Fair What Makes Surajkund Fair Unique?The Surajkund Fair is not just another crafts fair. It’s a melting pot of traditions, showcasing India’s diversity and participating countries’ cultural richness. Each year, the fair spotlights a “Theme State” from India and often a partner country, providing visitors with a deeper insight into the chosen region’s traditions, crafts, and cuisine.</description>
